<title>USA: Leflore Cty, Miss., won by Duncan Williams.</title>
<headline>Leflore Cty, Miss., won by Duncan Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duncan Williams said it won $2.700 million of Leflore Cty, Miss., general obligation public improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.04 percent.</p>
</text>
